## Manual Auditor Modes

Use a `manual-` prefix for primary on-demand audit modes so they sort separately from active loop/swarm modes.

| Mode Name | Purpose | Writes |
|---|---|---|
| `manual-template-auditor` | Template scaffold and templates-v2 integrity audit | `docs/TEMPLATE_AUDIT_REPORT.md` |
| `manual-doc-freshness-auditor` | Post-change doc freshness repair/check | Project docs/generated maps allowed by prompt |
| `manual-traceability-script-auditor` | Whole-repo traceability/script evidence audit | `docs/TRACEABILITY_SCRIPT_AUDIT_REPORT.md` |
| `manual-template-swarm-coverage-auditor` | Template-to-role coverage matrix audit | `docs/TEMPLATE_SWARM_COVERAGE_MATRIX.md` |
| `manual-ops-security-release-auditor` | Ops/security/release/rollback audit | `docs/OPS_SECURITY_RELEASE_AUDIT_REPORT.md` |
| `manual-ci-verify-gate-auditor` | CI/local verify/smoke/package command audit | `docs/CI_VERIFY_GATE_AUDIT_REPORT.md` |
| `manual-plan-state-consistency-auditor` | Plan/session/changelog/migration state consistency audit | `docs/PLAN_STATE_CONSISTENCY_AUDIT_REPORT.md` |

## Recommended Use

- Run `manual-template-swarm-coverage-auditor` after adding or renaming auditor modes, changing templates-v2, or considering operating-system-model migration.
- Run `manual-traceability-script-auditor` before asking a supervisor/orchestrator to repair traceability/script gaps.
- Run `manual-ci-verify-gate-auditor` after meaningful script, test, package, or CI changes.
- Run `manual-ops-security-release-auditor` before deployment/readiness phases or after server/secret/rollback changes.
- Run `manual-plan-state-consistency-auditor` when status docs feel contradictory or before a major handoff.

## Strategic Choice

Record whether this project is using:

- broad templates-v2 live docs,
